    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3630380/extras/43ff394140cca67d462089e76f16c3f1.avif?t=1747756826\" width=103 height=109 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Kitchen waits for no one.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We need quick hands, sharp eyes, and smart moves. If you can throw fast, match fruits, and mess with your rivals\u2014you might have what it takes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pick your role. Four characters, each with a special ability. Use it well, or get left behind.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Different arenas and game modes with each their own gameplay twists, no games are ever the same! (Except the fruits, they don't change much actually, I hope you like apples.)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Compete in intense <strong>PvP</strong> battles or team up in <strong>Coop</strong> modes for a more cozy/puzzle experience for <strong>up to 8 players</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >See you in the Kitchen, Chef.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3630380/extras/a4e9e1feb3cbc81e465797c0c70bf665.avif?t=1747756826\" width=103 height=109 /></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3630380/extras/43ff394140cca67d462089e76f16c3f1.avif?t=1747756826\" width=103 height=109 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Kitchen waits for no one.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We need quick hands, sharp eyes, and smart moves. If you can throw fast, match fruits, and mess with your rivals\u2014you might have what it takes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pick your role. Four characters, each with a special ability. Use it well, or get left behind.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Different arenas and game modes with each their own gameplay twists, no games are ever the same! (Except the fruits, they don't change much actually, I hope you like apples.)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Compete in intense <strong>PvP</strong> battles or team up in <strong>Coop</strong> modes for a more cozy/puzzle experience for <strong>up to 8 players</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >See you in the Kitchen, Chef.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3630380/extras/a4e9e1feb3cbc81e465797c0c70bf665.avif?t=1747756826\" width=103 height=109 /></span></p>",
    "short_description": "Fruit Wars is a chaotic multiplayer puzzle game where players throw fruits to create matches and score points! Outplay opponents by landing combos, blocking shots, or stealing points. Aim, throw and match to become the true Fruit Chef.",
    "supported_languages": "English, French, Japanese, Korean, Simplified Chinese, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain",
    "reviews": "\u201cEvery fruit counts.\u201d<br />\r\nChef Parm<br />\r\n",
